<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">She-Ra: Grayskull (1 of 3)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After what seemed like an eternity, Kyle is holding his newborn daughter in his hands. After staring at her face in awe, he finally is able to mutter the words â€œsheâ€™s... adora-â€ The word adorable is interrupted by a large blast that shakes the ship. Kyle holds on to his newborn baby daughter with all of his might through the shaking. He eventually hands her to Mara, who is laying against the wall. He kisses Mara and says â€œIâ€™ll be right back, take good care of herâ€. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œBefore you go...â€ Mara begins, â€œI like that nameâ€.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œWh-what name?â€ Kyle asks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œThe one you just said... Adoraâ€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;My own take on the story of She-Ra, inspired by the characters and lore mainly from the new series with a few references to the old one. Basically, Mara and Kyle are from Earth, and after a dust up with Horde Prime, they are forced to send their newborn baby Adora into a pocket dimension so she has a chance to survive on Etheria. 18 years later, she's grown up. This is her story.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>maevemarch</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
